      "writtenOn": "2022-08-08T13:06:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As this CL is written, it doesn\u0027t disable verification boot. If `verify_payload` is both doing verification and mounting then it will need to be refactored to extract two phases. It\u0027s already a little questionable that the mounting happens before committing to the DICE derivation. Perhaps it could be serialized to first do the verification and DICE followed by mounting everything in parallel?",
