      "writtenOn": "2022-08-09T01:45:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry for confusion; what I said \"mount\" is dm-verity, which just should be fine even when it happens before DICE derivation.\n\nAlso maybe we need to define what\u0027s exactly \"verification boot\": I think it\u0027s about payload update, not about APKs or APEXs. My question is: what do we get from disabling apk dm-verity?",
      "parentUuid": "1805fdfd_169d7c6e",
