      "writtenOn": "2022-08-09T17:08:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d taken the objective to be removing any obstacle from modifying the code that runs in a VM; verifying the signatures of images (APKs, APEXs, etc) is one of those obstacles.\n\nAPK dm-verity is a further layer of continuous protection after the APK itself has been verified. I consider that an ongoing enforcement of what was verified, rather than verification itself.\n\nIf these assumptions are wrong, then I\u0027m not reviewing the CL correctly.",
      "parentUuid": "1fc83f19_6ecf4882",
